Recommends: fonts-font-awesome
Description: resource-friendly status bar generator for i3 and sway
 i3status-rust feeds a status line to i3bar or swaybar: it emits a stream of
 JSON blocks on standard output, one update per block per interval, and the
 bar renders them. It replaces i3status, with a block set that covers CPU,
 memory, disk, network, battery, weather, music and a good deal more.
 .
 Blocks are configured rather than scripted. Each one is a TOML table naming
 the block type and its options, so a status line is a single config file with
 no shell loop behind it, and the daemon updates each block on its own
 schedule rather than repainting everything on a timer.
 .
 The icon and theme sets are installed to /usr/share/i3status-rust and are
 selected by name from the configuration.
